{"availability":"available","full":"roc-chiang/timo-decision-benchmark","name":"timo-decision-benchmark","description":"timo-decision-benchmark","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T02:57:08Z","updated":"2026-10-11T03:50:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://timobuy.com/demo","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:42.215Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:42.215Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:42.215Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:43.414Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:14:42.215Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( [](LICENSE) [](datasets/scenarios50.json) [](evaluator/runbenchmark.py)","\"Most AI agents are built to do more. We built one that knows when to stop.\" An open production benchmark evaluating whether specialized decision models can make better fiduciary consumer purchasing decisions than heavy frontier LLMs and rule engines—at a fraction of the cost and latency.","In the physical world, the highest-utility fiduciary advice is often: KEEP, WAIT, REPAIR, or SKIP."],"features":["Commercial Alignment (GMV Incentives): Traditional e-commerce bots are measured on conversion rates and affiliate commissions. They are structurally incentivized to validate buying impulses.","Sycophantic General LLMs: Frontier LLMs trained on web crawls mirror review blog hype cycles. Without explicit fiduciary guardrails, they act like eager retail salespeople."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/roc-chiang/timo-decision-benchmark/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"50d474b22d8ce6d3ea344d3952ce4cb4bdb35f1bfc68254e124ec2ab7c1c9e4f","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:43.526Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:43.526Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( [](LICENSE) [](datasets/scenarios50.json) [](evaluator/runbenchmark.py)","sourceUrl":"https:/